missions. The full power of the Netlify platform available from your AI agent.\",\n        \"title\": \"Netlify\",\n        \"remotes\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"streamable-http\",\n            \"url\": \"https://netlify-mcp.netlify.app/mcp\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"_meta\": {\n        \"com.anthropic.api/mcp-registry\": {\n          \"uuid\": \"816d73d2-2c34-4ad5-a1a3-c119c719e3af\",\n          \"type\": \"remote\",\n          \"toolNames\": [\n            \"netlify-coding-rules\",\n            \"netlify-user-services\",\n            \"netlify-deploy-services\",\n            \"netlify-team-services\",\n            \"netlify-project-services\",\n            \"netlify-extension-services\"\n          ],\n          \"promptNames\": [],\n          \"isAuthless\": false,\n          \"displayName\": \"Netlify\",\n          \"oneLiner\": \"Create, deploy, manage, and secure websites on Netlify.\",\n          \"iconUrl\": \"https://www.netlify.com/\",\n          \"documentation\": \"https://docs.netlify.com/build/build-with-ai/netlify-mcp-server/\",\n          \"support\": \"https://www.netlify.com/support/\",\n          \"privacyPolicy\": \"https://www.netlify.com/privacy/\",\n          \"url\": \"https://netlify-mcp.netlify.app/mcp\",\n          \"author\": {\n            \"name\": \"Netlify\",\n            \"url\": \"https://www.netlify.com/\"\n          },\n          \"slug\": \"netlify\",\n          \"directoryUrl\": \"https://claude.ai/directory/816d73d2-2c34-4ad5-a1a3-c119c719e3af\",\n          \"claudeCodeCopyText\": \"claude mcp add --transport http netlify https://netlify-mcp.netlify.app/mcp\",\n          \"permissions\": \"Read and write\",\n          \"useCases\": [\n            \"code\"\n          ],\n          \"worksWith\": [\n            \"claude\",\n            \"claude-api\",\n            \"claude-code\"\n          ],\n          \"publishedOn\": \"Mon Jan 12 2026 16:21:41 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)\",\n          \"createdOn\": \"Thu Aug 28 2025 14:02:56 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)\",\n          \"updatedOn\": \"Mon Jan 12 2026 16:20:14 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)\",\n          \"logo\": \"netlify\",\n          \"backgroundPattern\": \"Line 1\",\n          \"serverLabel\": \"netlify-mcp.netlify.app/mcp\",\n          \"itemId\": \"68b06190208a38617cb8e09a\",\n          \"collectionId\": \"68b05e2de975b4de7dd02d9d\",\n          \"localeId\": \"68a44d4040f98a4adf2207b5\",\n          \"htmlContent\": \"<p id=\\\"\\\">Create, deploy, and manage websites on Netlify. Control all aspects of your site from creating secrets to enforcing access controls to aggregating your form submissions. The full power of the Netlify platform available from Claude.</p><p id=\\\"\\\">You can use the Netlify connector to:<br><br>Create and deploy sites:<br>\\\"Create a new site on my Netlify team and deploy it\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Manage environment variables:<br>\\\"Create an environment variable called 'MY_API_KEY' and set it to the value 'hello, world'\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Configure access controls:<br>\\\"Turn on password protection for my site and set it to 'youshallnotpass'\\\"</p>\",\n          \"source\": \"auto-sync\",\n          \"visibility\": [\n            \"commercial\"\n          ],\n          \"added_at\": \"2025-11-12\",\n          \"rank\": 47,\n          \"popularityScore\": 14719,\n          \"scoreVersion\": \"v1\",\n          \"trendingScore\": 62384,\n          \"sortOrder\": 1\n        },\n        \"io.modelcontextprotocol.registry/official\": {\n          \"status\": \"active\",\n          \"isLatest\": true\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"server\": {\n        \"name\": \"com.snowflake/snowflake\",\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"description\": \"Snowflake MCP server can be used to securely and easily retrieve both structured and unstructured data from your Snowflake account\",\n        \"title\": \"Snowflake\",\n        \"remotes