          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "size": 283569,
            "text": "{\n  \"servers\": [\n    {\n      \"server\": {\n        \"$schema\": \"https://static.modelcontextprotocol.io/schemas/2025-09-16/server.schema.json\",\n        \"name\": \"com.jotform/mcp\",\n        \"description\": \"Create and edit online forms, then access and analyze submissions directly in Claude. Design forms through natural language, review incoming responses, and generate insights or reports without leaving the chat. Make data collection and analysis seamless, helping businesses, educators, and teams capture structured input and act on it instantly.\",\n        \"repository\": {\n          \"url\": \"https://github.com/jotform/mcp-server\",\n          \"source\": \"github\"\n        },\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"remotes\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"streamable-http\",\n            \"url\": \"https://mcp.jotform.com/mcp-app\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"title\": \"Jotform\"\n      },\n      \"_meta\": {\n        \"io.modelcontextprotocol.registry/official\": {\n          \"status\": \"active\",\n          \"publishedAt\": \"2025-10-02T10:40:19.104322Z\",\n          \"updatedAt\": \"2025-10-02T10:40:19.104322Z\",\n          \"isLatest\": true\n        },\n        \"com.anthropic.api/mcp-registry\": {\n          \"uuid\": \"aed7e2be-868e-4046-9e12-5c917b4e6b97\",\n          \"type\": \"remote\",\n          \"toolNames\": [\n            \"search\",\n            \"create_form\",\n            \"fetch\",\n            \"edit_form\",\n            \"create_submission\",\n            \"assign_form\"\n          ],\n          \"promptNames\": [],\n          \"isAuthless\": false,\n          \"displayName\": \"Jotform\",\n          \"oneLiner\": \"Create forms & analyze submissions inside Claude\",\n          \"iconUrl\": \"https://mcp.jotform.com/\",\n          \"documentation\": \"https://www.jotform.com/developers/mcp/\",\n          \"support\": \"https://www.jotform.com/contact/\",\n          \"privacyPolicy\": \"https://www.jotform.com/privacy/\",\n          \"url\": \"https://mcp.jotform.com/mcp-app\",\n          \"author\": {\n            \"name\": \"Jotform\",\n            \"url\": \"https://www.jotform.com/\"\n          },\n          \"slug\": \"jotform\",\n          \"directoryUrl\": \"https://claude.ai/directory/aed7e2be-868e-4046-9e12-5c917b4e6b97\",\n          \"claudeCodeCopyText\": \"claude mcp add --transport http jotform https://mcp.jotform.com/mcp-app\",\n          \"permissions\": \"Read and write\",\n          \"useCases\": [\n            \"productivity\"\n          ],\n          \"worksWith\": [\n            \"claude\",\n            \"claude-api\",\n            \"claude-code\"\n          ],\n          \"publishedOn\": \"Mon Jan 12 2026 16:21:41 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)\",\n          \"createdOn\": \"Fri Sep 12 2025 22:49:25 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)\",\n          \"updatedOn\": \"Mon Jan 12 2026 16:20:15 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)\",\n          \"logo\": \"jotform\",\n          \"backgroundPattern\": \"Loop 2\",\n          \"serverLabel\": \"mcp.jotform.com/mcp-app\",\n          \"itemId\": \"68c4a37524f6247993bccbe5\",\n          \"collectionId\": \"68b05e2de975b4de7dd02d9d\",\n          \"localeId\": \"68a44d4040f98a4adf2207b5\",\n          \"htmlContent\": \"<p id=\\\"\\\">Create and edit online forms, then access and analyze submissions directly in Claude. Design forms through natural language, review incoming responses, and generate insights or reports without leaving the chat. Make data collection and analysis seamless, helping businesses, educators, and teams capture structured input and act on it instantly.</p><p id=\\\"\\\">You can use the Jotform connector to:<br><br>Create forms with natural language:<br>\\\"Create a customer feedback form with fields for name, email, satisfaction rating (1–5), and an optional comments box\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Edit existing forms:<br>\\\"Open my 'Job Application' form and add a required field asking for a LinkedIn profile URL\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Review and analyze submissions:<br>\\\"Show me the last 20 submissions to my 'Event Registration' form and summarize how many people selected each ticket type\\\"</p>\",\n          \"source\": \"auto-sync\",\n          \"visibility\": [\n            \"commercial\"\n          ],\n          \"added_at\": \"2025-11-12\",\n          \"rank\": 103,\n          \"popularityScore\": 12505,\n          \"scoreVersion\": \"v1\",\n          \"trendingScore\": 68211\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"server\": {\n        \"name\": \"com.ravenpack.bigdata/bigdata\",\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"description\": \"The Bigdata.com MCP server integrates institutional-grade data directly into your AI workflow, covering global news, transcripts, and regulatory filings directly in Claude. By combining Claude's reasoning with Bigdata.com's entity-aware search, you can automate complex due diligence and produce hallucination-free reports with full citation trails. Empower your decision-making with the only AI connector that is Grounded by Design for professional finance.\",\n        \"title\": \"Bigdata.com\",\n        \"remotes\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"streamable-http\",\n            \"url\": \"https://mcp.bigdata.com/\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"_meta\": {\n        \"com.anthropic.api/mcp-registry\": {\n          \"uuid\": \"e463df16-b3d7-4bb9-953d-b652a073c764\",\n          \"type\": \"remote\",\n          \"toolNames\": [\n            \"bigdata_events_calendar\",\n            \"find_companies\",\n            \"bigdata_search\",\n            \"bigdata_tearsheet\"\n          ],\n          \"promptNames\": [],\n          \"isAuthless\": false,\n          \"displayName\": \"Bigdata.com\",\n          \"oneLiner\": \"Access real-time financial data\",\n          \"iconUrl\": \"https://bigdata.com\",\n          \"documentation\": \"https://docs.bigdata.com/mcp-reference\",\n          \"support\": \"mailto:support@bigdata.com\",\n          \"privacyPolicy\": \"https://bigdata.com/mcp-terms-and-conditions\",\n          \"url\": \"https://mcp.bigdata.com/\",\n          \"author\": {\n            \"name\": \"RavenPack\",\n            \"url\": \"https://www.ravenpack.com\"\n          },\n          \"slug\": \"bigdata\",\n          \"directoryUrl\": \"https://claude.ai/directory/e463df16-b3d7-4bb9-953d-b652a073c764\",\n          \"claudeCodeCopyText\": \"claude mcp add --transport http bigdata https://mcp.bigdata.com/\\n\",\n          \"worksWith\": [\n            \"claude\",\n            \"claude-api\"\n          ],\n          \"logo\": \"bigdata\",\n          \"backgroundPattern\": \"Line 1\",\n          \"serverLabel\": \"mcp.bigdata.com\",\n          \"source\": \"manual\",\n          \"visibility\": [\n            \"commercial\"\n          ],\n          \"useCases\": [\n            \"financial-services\"\n          ],\n          \"permissions\": \"Read Only\",\n          \"added_at\": \"2026-02-04\",\n          \"rank\": 104,\n          \"popularityScore\": 12497,\n          \"scoreVersion\": \"v1\",\n          \"trendingScore\": 53657\n        },\n        \"io.modelcontextprotocol.registry/official\": {\n          \"status\": \"active\",\n          \"isLatest\": true\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"server\": {\n        \"name\": \"com.lseg.analytics.api/lseg\",\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"description\": \"The LSEG Connector provides real-time access to LSEG's comprehensive financial market data ecosystem, spanning across asset classes and domains. It enables seamless integration of institutional-grade market data, analytics, and valuation tools directly into conversational AI workflows, allowing users to access deep market insights, perform complex calculations, and analyze financial instruments through natural language interactions.\",\n        \"title\": \"LSEG\",\n        \"remotes\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"streamable-http\",\n            \"url\": \"https://api.analytics.lseg.com/lfa/mcp/server-cl\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"_meta\": {\n        \"com.anthropic.api/mcp-registry\": {\n          \"uuid\": \"5f26bc32-8582-4df7-ab88-19c507f8505b\",\n          \"type\": \"remote\",\n          \"toolNames\": [\n            \"fx_spot_price\",\n            \"fx_forward_price\",\n            \"bond_price\",\n            \"bond_future_price\",\n            \"option_value\",\n            \"ir_swap\",\n            \"interest_rate_curve\",\n            \"credit_curve\",\n            \"inflation_curve\",\n            \"fx_forward_curve\",\n            \"qa_ibes_consensus\",\n            \"qa_macroeconomic\",\n            \"qa_company_fundamentals\",\n            \"fx_vol_surface\",\n            \"equity_vol_surface\",\n            \"insight_headlines\",\n            \"tscc_historical_pricing_summaries\",\n            \"fixed_income_bond_reference\",\n            \"fixed_income_risk_analytics\",\n            \"yieldbook_scenario_calculation\"\n          ],\n          \"promptNames\": [],\n          \"isAuthless\": false,\n          \"displayName\": \"LSEG\",\n          \"oneLiner\": \"Access best in class data & analytics across a broad spectrum of asset classes.\",\n          \"iconUrl\": \"https://www.lseg.com/\",\n          \"documentation\": \"https://www.lseg.com/en/solutions/ai-finance-solutions/anthropic\",\n          \"support\": \"https://www.lseg.com/en/product-support\",\n          \"privacyPolicy\": \"https://www.lseg.com/en/policies/privacy-statement\",\n          \"url\": \"https://api.analytics.lseg.com/lfa/mcp\",\n          \"author\": {\n            \"name\": \"LSEG\",\n            \"url\": \"https://www.lseg.com/\"\n          },\n          \"slug\": \"london-stock-exchange-group\",\n          \"directoryUrl\": \"https://claude.ai/directory/5f26bc32-8582-4df7-ab88-19c507f8505b\",\n          \"permissions\": \"Read\",\n          \"useCases\": [\n            \"financial-services\"\n          ],\n          \"worksWith\": [\n            \"claude\",\n            \"claude-api\"\n          ],\n          \"publishedOn\": \"Mon Jan 12 2026 16:21:41 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)\",\n          \"createdOn\": \"Fri Oct 24 2025 19:51:26 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)\",\n          \"updatedOn\": \"Mon Jan 12 2026 16:20:13 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)\",\n          \"logo\": \"lseg\",\n          \"serverLabel\": \"api.analytics.lseg.com/lfa/mcp\",\n          \"itemId\": \"68fbd8be213a6c102338dd97\",\n          \"collectionId\": \"68b05e2de975b4de7dd02d9d\",\n          \"localeId\": \"68a44d4040f98a4adf2207b5\",\n          \"htmlContent\": \"<p id=\\\"\\\">Provides real-time access to LSEG's comprehensive financial market data ecosystem, spanning across asset classes and domains. It enables seamless integration of institutional-grade market data, analytics, and valuation tools directly into conversational workflows, allowing users to access deep market insights, perform complex calculations, and analyze financial instruments through natural language interactions.</p><p id=\\\"\\\">You can use the LSEG connector to:<br><br>Get current FX spot rates:<br>\\\"What is the current EUR/GBP spot rate?\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Check historical spot rates:<br>\\\"What was the GBP spot rate on July 2nd, 2025?\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Price FX forward rates:<br>\\\"What's the value of the aussie tomnext?\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Calculate forward tenors:<br>\\\"What's the price of a 1 Month EURCHF forward?\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Price forwards via cross rates:<br>\\\"What's the price of a 30D NOKSEK forward via EUR?\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Get historical forward prices:<br>\\\"How did a 1M EUR / CHF forward look like on 14/11/2025?\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Plot interest rate curves:<br>\\\"I'd like to plot the USD SOFR swap curve\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">List available interest rate curves:<br>\\\"What are the interest rate curves covered by LSEG?\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Get FX forward curves:<br>\\\"Can I get the AUD / USD fx curve using AONIA / SOFR cbs?\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Calculate bond yields:<br>\\\"What's the yield of FR0014012II5?\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Get bond descriptions and overviews:<br>\\\"Can you provide me with an overview of FR0014012II5?\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Display bond cash flows:<br>\\\"Can you display the cash flows of FR10YT=RR?\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Calculate spread measures:<br>\\\"Can I get the spread measure of FR0014012II5 for the current market price?\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Price bonds for specific spreads:<br>\\\"What would be the price of FR0014012II5 for a z-spread of 90?\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Calculate yields using custom conventions:<br>\\\"Can you provide the yield of US91282CNT44 using a Japanese simple convention?\\\"</p>\",\n          \"source\": \"auto-sync\",\n          \"visibility\": [\n            \"commercial\"\n          ],\n          \"added_at\": \"2025-11-14\",\n          \"rank\": 105,\n          \"popularityScore\": 12482,\n          \"scoreVersion\": \"v1\",\n          \"trendingScore\": 61049\n        },\n        \"io.modelcontextprotocol.registry/official\": {\n          \"status\": \"active\",\n          \"isLatest\": true\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"server\": {\n        \"$schema\": \"https://static.modelcontextprotocol.io/schemas/2025-10-17/server.schema.json\",\n        \"name\": \"com.egnyte/mcp-server\",\n        \"description\": \"Egnyte MCP server enables AI agents to securely search, retrieve, and analyze content stored in any Egnyte domain. It wraps Egnyte’s public APIs and enforces native permissions, compliance rules, and audit logging.\",\n        \"title\": \"Egnyte\",\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"remotes\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"streamable-http\",\n            \"url\": \"https://mcp-server.egnyte.com/mcp\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"_meta\": {\n          \"io.modelcontextprotocol.registry/publisher-provided\": {\n            \"authorizationUrl\": \"https://mcp-oauth.egnyte.com/domain_picker.html\",\n            \"documentationUrl\": \"https://developers.egnyte.com/api-docs/remote-mcp-server\"\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"_meta\": {\n        \"io.modelcontextprotocol.registry/official\": {\n          \"status\": \"active\",\n          \"publishedAt\": \"2025-11-07T14:32:39.484051Z\",\n          \"updatedAt\": \"2025-11-07T14:32:39.484051Z\",\n          \"isLatest\": true\n        },\n        \"com.anthropic.api/mcp-registry\": {\n          \"uuid\": \"5b938bac-8286-4844-bc51-d303f7c6cbde\",\n          \"type\": \"remote\",\n          \"toolNames\": [\n            \"search\",\n            \"advanced_search\",\n            \"fetch\",\n            \"ask_document\",\n            \"summarize_document\",\n            \"list_filesystem_by_path\",\n            \"list_filesystem_by_id\",\n            \"download_file_by_path\",\n            \"download_file_by_id\",\n            \"ask_copilot\",\n            \"ask_knowledge_base\",\n            \"list_knowledge_bases\",\n            \"get_folder_stats\",\n            \"search_projects_by_folder\",\n            \"get_project_details\",\n            \"list_projects\",\n            \"get_workflow_details\",\n            \"list_workflows\",\n            \"list_workflow_tasks\",\n            \"get_comment\",\n            \"list_comments\",\n            \"get_link_details\",\n            \"list_links\"\n          ],\n          \"promptNames\": [],\n          \"isAuthless\": false,\n          \"displayName\": \"Egnyte\",\n          \"oneLiner\": \"Securely access and analyze Egnyte content\",\n          \"iconUrl\": \"https://www.egnyte.com\",\n          \"documentation\": \"https://developers.egnyte.com/docs/Remote_MCP_Server\",\n          \"support\": \"mailto:support@egnyte.com\",\n          \"privacyPolicy\": \"https://www.egnyte.com/privacy-policy\",\n          \"url\": \"https://mcp-server.egnyte.com/mcp\",\n          \"author\": {\n            \"name\": \"Egnyte, Inc.\",\n            \"url\": \"https://www.egnyte.com\"\n          },\n          \"slug\": \"egnyte\",\n          \"directoryUrl\": \"https://claude.ai/directory/5b938bac-8286-4844-bc51-d303f7c6cbde\",\n          \"claudeCodeCopyText\": \"claude mcp add --transport http egnyte https://mcp-server.egnyte.com/mcp\",\n          \"permissions\": \"Read\",\n          \"useCases\": [\n            \"financial-services\"\n          ],\n          \"worksWith\": [\n            \"claude\",\n            \"claude-api\",\n            \"claude-code\"\n          ],\n          \"publishedOn\": \"Mon Jan 12 2026 16:21:41 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)\",\n          \"createdOn\": \"Sat Oct 04 2025 00:46:26 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)\",\n          \"updatedOn\": \"Mon Jan 12 2026 16:20:13 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)\",\n          \"logo\": \"egnyte\",\n          \"backgroundPattern\": \"Loop 1\",\n          \"heroVideoId\": \"NcBnxbEC0Ng\",\n          \"heroVideoPreviewLink\": \"https://cdn.sanity.io/files/4zrzovbb/website/a54eb3ff1905181f18896427f19113722577969a.mp4\",\n          \"serverLabel\": \"mcp-server.egnyte.com/mcp\",\n          \"itemId\": \"68e06e6232b17a59b6917957\",\n          \"collectionId\": \"68b05e2de975b4de7dd02d9d\",\n          \"localeId\": \"68a44d4040f98a4adf2207b5\",\n          \"htmlContent\": \"<p id=\\\"\\\">Securely search, retrieve, and analyze content stored in any Egnyte domain. The Egnyte Connector wraps Egnyte’s public APIs and enforces native permissions, compliance rules, and audit logging.<br><br>You can use the Egnyte connector to:<br><br>Analyze financial reports with visuals:<br>\\\"What are the main findings in the MSFT Q4 financial data? Create a report with charts\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Review contract risks:<br>\\\"Can you analyze the risk factors mentioned in the Intellectual Property Rights Agreement?\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Get policy summaries with Copilot:<br>\\\"Ask Copilot to summarize our company's key HR policies\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Check project status:<br>\\\"Get the current status and details for the Marshall School project from Egnyte\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Summarize documents:<br>\\\"Summarize the key points from the 'Travel Policy' document\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Get folder insights and statistics:<br>\\\"How much space is used by our 'Project ABC' folder?\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">List shared links:<br>\\\"List all shared links for files in the 'Large PowerPoint PPT' folder\\\"</p>\",\n          \"source\": \"auto-sync\",\n          \"visibility\": [\n            \"commercial\"\n          ],\n          \"added_at\": \"2025-11-12\",\n          \"rank\": 106,\n          \"popularityScore\": 12479,\n          \"scoreVersion\": \"v1\",\n          \"trendingScore\": 47962\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"server\": {\n        \"name\": \"com.usepylon/mcp\",\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"description\": \"Access Pylon's customer support platform directly from Claude to search, manage, and resolve customer issues. Stay on top of your support queue while connecting Claude's insights to real customer conversations.\",\n        \"title\": \"Pylon\",\n        \"remotes\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"streamable-http\",\n            \"url\": \"https://mcp.usepylon.com/\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"_meta\": {\n        \"com.anthropic.api/mcp-registry\": {\n          \"uuid\": \"240b8712-17ed-4233-858a-9a872dec63b2\",\n          \"type\": \"remote\",\n          \"toolNames\": [\n            \"create_issue\",\n            \"get_account\",\n            \"get_contact\",\n            \"get_issue\",\n            \"get_issue_messages\",\n            \"get_user\",\n            \"search_accounts\",\n            \"search_issues\",\n            \"update_account\",\n            \"update_issue\"\n          ],\n          \"promptNames\": [],\n          \"isAuthless\": false,\n          \"displayName\": \"Pylon\",\n          \"oneLiner\": \"Search and manage Pylon support issues\",\n          \"iconUrl\": \"https://www.usepylon.com\",\n          \"documentation\": \"https://support.usepylon.com/articles/2407390554-connecting-to-the-pylon-mcp-server?lang=en\",\n          \"support\": \"mailto:support@usepylon.com\",\n          \"privacyPolicy\": \"https://www.usepylon.com/privacy\",\n          \"url\": \"https://mcp.usepylon.com/\",\n          \"author\": {\n            \"name\": \"Pylon\",\n            \"url\": \"https://www.usepylon.com/\"\n          },\n          \"slug\": \"pylon\",\n          \"directoryUrl\": \"https://claude.ai/directory/240b8712-17ed-4233-858a-9a872dec63b2\",\n          \"claudeCodeCopyText\": \"claude mcp add --transport http pylon https://mcp.usepylon.com/\\n\",\n          \"worksWith\": [\n            \"claude\",\n            \"claude-api\",\n            \"claude-code\"\n          ],\n          \"logo\": \"pylon\",\n          \"backgroundPattern\": \"Line 1\",\n          \"serverLabel\": \"mcp.usepylon.com\",\n          \"source\": \"manual\",\n          \"visibility\": [\n            \"commercial\"\n          ],\n          \"useCases\": [\n            \"communication\"\n          ],\n          \"permissions\": \"Read and write\",\n          \"added_at\": \"2026-03-03\",\n          \"rank\": 107,\n          \"popularityScore\": 12453,\n          \"scoreVersion\": \"v1\",\n          \"trendingScore\": 53317\n        },\n        \"io.modelcontextprotocol.registry/official\": {\n          \"status\": \"active\",\n          \"isLatest\": true\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"server\": {\n        \"name\": \"com.mercury.mcp/mercury\",\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"description\": \"Check your balance, download statements, search/analyze/graph transactions, and understand Cards directly from Claude. Mercury brings your finances into your AI tools\",\n        \"title\": \"Mercury\",\n        \"remotes\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"streamable-http\",\n            \"url\": \"https://mcp.mercury.com/mcp\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"_meta\": {\n        \"com.anthropic.api/mcp-registry\": {\n          \"uuid\": \"9c04294a-d69c-47e9-9fa6-6a0e780caf3a\",\n          \"type\": \"remote\",\n          \"toolNames\": [\n            \"load_account\",\n            \"load_transaction\",\n            \"load_recipient\",\n            \"load_account_statement\",\n            \"load_accounts_card\"\n          ],\n          \"promptNames\": [],\n          \"isAuthless\": false,\n          \"displayName\": \"Mercury\",\n          \"oneLiner\": \"Search, analyze and understand your finances on Mercury\",\n          \"iconUrl\": \"https://mercury.com\",\n          \"documentation\": \"https://docs.mercury.com/docs/connecting-mercury-mcp\",\n          \"support\": \"mailto:api@mercury.com\",\n          \"privacyPolicy\": \"https://mercury.com/legal/privacy\",\n          \"url\": \"https://mcp.mercury.com/mcp\",\n          \"author\": {\n            \"name\": \"Mercury\",\n            \"url\": \"https://mercury.com\"\n          },\n          \"worksWith\": [\n            \"claude\",\n            \"claude-api\",\n            \"claude-code\"\n          ],\n          \"source\": \"auto-sync\",\n          \"visibility\": [\n            \"commercial\"\n          ],\n          \"added_at\": \"2026-01-12\",\n          \"useCases\": [\n            \"financial-services\"\n          ],\n          \"rank\": 108,\n          \"popularityScore\": 12439,\n          \"scoreVersion\": \"v1\",\n          \"trendingScore\": 49014,\n          \"sortOrder\": 1\n        },\n        \"io.modelcontextprotocol.registry/official\": {\n          \"status\": \"active\",\n          \"isLatest\": true\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"server\": {\n        \"name\": \"co.omni/mcp\",\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"description\": \"Query Omni using the same semantic model, permissions, and logic defined by your data team directly from Claude. Instantly answer questions about your business using natural language — no need to write SQL or navigate complex dashboards. Your Omni semantic model becomes Claude's knowledge of your data, enabling secure, governed, and consistent analytics workflows across your organization.\",\n        \"title\": \"Omni Analytics\",\n        \"remotes\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"streamable-http\",\n            \"url\": \"https://callbacks.omniapp.co/callback/mcp\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"_meta\": {\n        \"com.anthropic.api/mcp-registry\": {\n          \"uuid\": \"8e7324aa-2671-46bf-9447-5bba8ccf8c2f\",\n          \"type\": \"remote\",\n          \"toolNames\": [\n            \"pickModel\",\n            \"pickTopic\",\n            \"getData\"\n          ],\n          \"promptNames\": [],\n          \"isAuthless\": false,\n          \"displayName\": \"Omni Analytics\",\n          \"oneLiner\": \"Query your data using natural language through Omni's semantic model\",\n          \"iconUrl\": \"https://omni.co/favicon.ico\",\n          \"documentation\": \"https://docs.omni.co/ai/mcp\",\n          \"support\": \"mailto:support@omni.co\",\n          \"privacyPolicy\": \"https://www.omni.co/privacy\",\n          \"url\": \"https://callbacks.omniapp.co/callback/mcp\",\n          \"author\": {\n            \"name\": \"Omni Analytics\",\n            \"url\": \"https://www.omni.co/\"\n          },\n          \"slug\": \"omni-analytics\",\n          \"directoryUrl\": \"https://claude.ai/directory/8e7324aa-2671-46bf-9447-5bba8ccf8c2f\",\n          \"claudeCodeCopyText\": \"claude mcp add --transport http omni-analytics https://callbacks.omniapp.co/callback/mcp\\n\",\n          \"worksWith\": [\n            \"claude\",\n            \"claude-api\",\n            \"claude-code\"\n          ],\n          \"logo\": \"omni-analytics\",\n          \"backgroundPattern\": \"Line 1\",\n          \"serverLabel\": \"callbacks.omniapp.co/callback/mcp\",\n          \"source\": \"manual\",\n          \"visibility\": [\n            \"commercial\"\n          ],\n          \"useCases\": [\n            \"data\"\n          ],\n          \"permissions\": \"Read\",\n          \"added_at\": \"2026-03-08\",\n          \"rank\": 109,\n          \"popularityScore\": 12368,\n          \"scoreVersion\": \"v1\",\n          \"trendingScore\": 68298\n        },\n        \"io.modelcontextprotocol.registry/official\": {\n          \"status\": \"active\",\n          \"isLatest\": true\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"server\": {\n        \"name\": \"com.calendly/mcp\",\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"description\": \"Schedule smarter with Calendly in Claude. Manage your entire scheduling workflow through simple conversation — create and update event types, share scheduling links, adjust availability, book meetings, and more, without ever leaving Claude.\",\n        \"title\": \"Calendly\",\n        \"remotes\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"streamable-http\",\n            \"url\": \"https://mcp.calendly.com\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"_meta\": {\n        \"com.anthropic.api/mcp-registry\": {\n          \"uuid\": \"d778b2f9-25f4-42a2-87ab-dbaa896deb1b\",\n          \"type\": \"remote\",\n          \"toolNames\": [\n            \"users-get_current_user\",\n            \"users-get_user\",\n            \"event_types-create_event_type\",\n            \"event_types-update_event_type\",\n            \"event_types-list_event_types\",\n            \"event_types-get_event_type\",\n            \"event_types-list_event_type_available_times\",\n            \"event_types-list_event_type_availability_schedules\",\n            \"event_types-update_event_type_availability_schedule\",\n            \"locations-list_user_meeting_locations\",\n            \"scheduled_events-list_events\",\n            \"scheduled_events-get_event\",\n            \"scheduled_events-cancel_event\",\n            \"scheduled_events-create_event_invitee\",\n            \"scheduled_events-list_event_invitees\",\n            \"scheduled_events-get_event_invitee\",\n            \"scheduling_links-create_scheduling_link\",\n            \"availability-list_user_availability_schedules\",\n            \"availability-get_user_availability_schedule\",\n            \"availability-list_user_busy_times\",\n            \"scheduled_events-create_invitee_no_show\",\n            \"scheduled_events-get_invitee_no_show\",\n            \"scheduled_events-delete_invitee_no_show\",\n            \"organizations-get_organization\",\n            \"organizations-list_organization_memberships\",\n            \"organizations-get_organization_membership\",\n            \"organizations-delete_organization_membership\",\n            \"organizations-list_organization_invitations\",\n            \"organizations-create_organization_invitation\",\n            \"organizations-revoke_organization_invitation\",\n            \"routing_forms-list_routing_forms\",\n            \"routing_forms-get_routing_form\",\n            \"routing_forms-list_routing_form_submissions\",\n            \"routing_forms-get_routing_form_submission\"\n          ],\n          \"promptNames\": [],\n          \"isAuthless\": false,\n          \"displayName\": \"Calendly\",\n          \"oneLiner\": \"Manage event types, availability, and bookings.\",\n          \"iconUrl\": \"https://calendly.com\",\n          \"documentation\": \"https://help.calendly.com/hc/en-us/articles/36734570264855-Connect-Calendly-to-your-AI-tools-with-Calendly-MCP\",\n          \"support\": \"mailto:support+developer@calendly.com\",\n          \"privacyPolicy\": \"https://calendly.com/legal/privacy-notice\",\n          \"url\": \"https://mcp.calendly.com\",\n          \"author\": {\n            \"name\": \"Calendly\",\n            \"url\": \"https://calendly.com\"\n          },\n          \"slug\": \"calendly\",\n          \"directoryUrl\": \"https://claude.ai/directory/d778b2f9-25f4-42a2-87ab-dbaa896deb1b\",\n          \"worksWith\": [\n            \"claude\",\n            \"claude-api\"\n          ],\n          \"logo\": \"calendly\",\n          \"backgroundPattern\": \"Line 1\",\n          \"serverLabel\": \"mcp.calendly.com\",\n          \"source\": \"manual\",\n          \"visibility\": [\n            \"commercial\"\n          ],\n          \"useCases\": [\n            \"productivity\"\n          ],\n          \"permissions\": \"Read and write\",\n          \"added_at\": \"2026-03-12\",\n          \"rank\": 110,\n          \"popularityScore\": 12311,\n          \"scoreVersion\": \"v1\",\n          \"trendingScore\": 3342219,\n          \"trending\": true\n        },\n        \"io.modelcontextprotocol.registry/official\": {\n          \"status\": \"active\",\n          \"isLatest\": true\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"server\": {\n        \"name\": \"io.honeycomb.mcp/honeycomb\",\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"description\": \"Query and explore observability data from OpenTelemetry or dozens of other sources in your honeycomb.io account.\",\n        \"title\": \"Honeycomb\",\n        \"remotes\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"streamable-http\",\n            \"url\": \"https://mcp.honeycomb.io/mcp\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"_meta\": {\n        \"com.anthropic.api/mcp-registry\": {\n          \"uuid\": \"63125588-06e1-4567-8130-f5a26ed1d20f\",\n          \"type\": \"remote\",\n          \"toolNames\": [\n            \"feedback\",\n            \"get_dataset\",\n            \"get_dataset_columns\",\n            \"get_environment\",\n            \"get_query_history\",\n            \"get_slos\",\n            \"get_team_info\",\n            \"get_trace\",\n            \"get_triggers\",\n            \"list_datasets\",\n            \"list_environments\",\n            \"run_unsaved_query\",\n            \"search_columns\"\n          ],\n          \"promptNames\": [],\n          \"isAuthless\": false,\n          \"displayName\": \"Honeycomb\",\n          \"oneLiner\": \"Query and explore observability data and SLOs\",\n          \"iconUrl\": \"https://www.honeycomb.io\",\n          \"documentation\": \"https://docs.honeycomb.io/troubleshoot/product-lifecycle/beta/mcp/\",\n          \"support\": \"https://www.honeycomb.io/support\",\n          \"privacyPolicy\": \"https://www.honeycomb.io/ai-terms\",\n          \"url\": \"https://mcp.honeycomb.io/mcp\",\n          \"author\": {\n            \"name\": \"honeycomb.io\",\n            \"url\": \"https://www.honeycomb.io\"\n          },\n          \"slug\": \"honeycomb\",\n          \"directoryUrl\": \"https://claude.ai/directory/63125588-06e1-4567-8130-f5a26ed1d20f\",\n          \"claudeCodeCopyText\": \"claude mcp add --transport http honeycomb https://mcp.honeycomb.io/mcp\",\n          \"permissions\": \"Read and write\",\n          \"useCases\": [\n            \"data\"\n          ],\n          \"worksWith\": [\n            \"claude\",\n            \"claude-api\",\n            \"claude-code\"\n          ],\n          \"publishedOn\": \"Mon Jan 12 2026 16:21:41 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)\",\n          \"createdOn\": \"Mon Nov 24 2025 01:35:04 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)\",\n          \"updatedOn\": \"Mon Jan 12 2026 16:20:18 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)\",\n          \"logo\": \"honeycomb\",\n          \"serverLabel\": \"mcp.honeycomb.io/mcp\",\n          \"itemId\": \"6923b648dad3246a3f347c6a\",\n          \"collectionId\": \"68b05e2de975b4de7dd02d9d\",\n          \"localeId\": \"68a44d4040f98a4adf2207b5\",\n          \"htmlContent\": \"<p id=\\\"\\\">Query and explore observability data from OpenTelemetry or dozens of other sources in your honeycomb.io account.<br><br>You can use the Honeycomb connector to:</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Analyze SLO Performance:<strong id=\\\"\\\"><br>‍</strong>\\\"Analyze my SLO burn rates and investigate the top three contributing factors\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Generate Usage Reports:<strong id=\\\"\\\"><br>‍</strong>\\\"Give me a report on usage of my application by iOS version\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Troubleshoot Performance Issues:<strong id=\\\"\\\"><br>‍</strong>\\\"Why are some users experiencing higher latency and error rate on my API server?\\\"</p>\",\n          \"source\": \"auto-sync\",\n          \"visibility\": [\n            \"commercial\"\n          ],\n          \"added_at\": \"2025-11-26\",\n          \"rank\": 111,\n          \"popularityScore\": 12299,\n          \"scoreVersion\": \"v1\",\n          \"trendingScore\": 44796,\n          \"sortOrder\": 1\n        },\n        \"io.modelcontextprotocol.registry/official\": {\n          \"status\": \"active\",\n          \"isLatest\": true\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"server\": {\n        \"name\": \"com.supermetrics/supermetrics\",\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"description\": \"Supermetrics MCP Server connects Claude to the 200+ marketing platforms so you can find, pull, and act on marketing, sales, and analytics data through natural language. It's great for quick performance answers, diagnosing problem situations, and turning questions into tables, summaries or visualizations.\",\n        \"title\": \"Supermetrics\",\n        \"remotes\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"streamable-http\",\n            \"url\": \"https://mcp.supermetrics.com/mcp\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"_meta\": {\n        \"com.anthropic.api/mcp-registry\": {\n          \"uuid\": \"cc599e7b-8c59-4e89-9bf0-36d47bb9ec80\",\n          \"type\": \"remote\",\n          \"toolNames\": [\n            \"data_source_discovery\",\n            \"accounts_discovery\",\n            \"field_discovery\",\n            \"data_query\",\n            \"get_async_query_results\",\n            \"get_today\"\n          ],\n          \"promptNames\": [],\n          \"isAuthless\": false,\n          \"displayName\": \"Supermetrics\",\n          \"oneLiner\": \"Analyze marketing performance across 200+ platforms\",\n          \"iconUrl\": \"https://supermetrics.com\",\n          \"documentation\": \"https://mcp.supermetrics.com/docs\",\n          \"support\": \"https://support.supermetrics.com\",\n          \"privacyPolicy\": \"https://supermetrics.com/privacy-policy\",\n          \"url\": \"https://mcp.supermetrics.com/mcp\",\n          \"author\": {\n            \"name\": \"Supermetrics\",\n            \"url\": \"https://supermetrics.com\"\n          },\n          \"slug\": \"supermetrics\",\n          \"directoryUrl\": \"https://claude.ai/directory/cc599e7b-8c59-4e89-9bf0-36d47bb9ec80\",\n          \"worksWith\": [\n            \"claude\",\n            \"claude-api\"\n          ],\n          \"logo\": \"supermetrics\",\n          \"backgroundPattern\": \"Line 1\",\n          \"serverLabel\": \"mcp.supermetrics.com/mcp\",\n          \"source\": \"manual\",\n          \"visibility\": [\n            \"commercial\"\n          ],\n          \"useCases\": [\n            \"sales-and-marketing\"\n          ],\n          \"permissions\": \"Read\",\n          \"added_at\": \"2026-02-11\",\n          \"rank\": 112,\n          \"popularityScore\": 12285,\n          \"scoreVersion\": \"v1\",\n          \"trendingScore\": 58797\n        },\n        \"io.modelcontextprotocol.registry/official\": {\n          \"status\": \"active\",\n          \"isLatest\": true\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"server\": {\n        \"name\": \"com.msci/msci\",\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"description\": \"Access an expanding range of MSCI AI-enabled data and analytics capabilities. Clients can use natural language queries to explore our equity index data and support materials based on their licensed content. Users can investigate and compare MSCI index performance characteristics such as country, sector and factor exposures, constituent weights and methodologies. Designed for investment professionals who need transparent and high-quality index data and insights for portfolio construction, attribution and exposure analysis.\",\n        \"title\": \"MSCI\",\n        \"remotes\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"streamable-http\",\n            \"url\": \"https://mcp.msci.com/index/index-mcp/v1.0/mcp\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"_meta\": {\n        \"com.anthropic.api/mcp-registry\": {\n          \"uuid\": \"2cc10749-99cb-4853-a9d7-b2292ec589fc\",\n          \"type\": \"remote\",\n          \"toolNames\": [\n            \"getIndexGQLSchemaFragments\",\n            \"executeIndexGQLSchema\"\n          ],\n          \"promptNames\": [\n            \"Welcome_text\"\n          ],\n          \"isAuthless\": false,\n          \"displayName\": \"MSCI\",\n          \"oneLiner\": \"Converse, query and comprehend a world of MSCI indexes\",\n          \"iconUrl\": \"https://msci.com\",\n          \"documentation\": \"https://www.msci.com/downloads/documents/index/resources/indexai-insights-user-guide-feb26.pdf\",\n          \"support\": \"mailto:support@msci.com\",\n          \"privacyPolicy\": \"https://www.msci.com/legal/privacy-notice\",\n          \"url\": \"https://mcp.msci.com/index/index-mcp/v1.0/mcp\",\n          \"author\": {\n            \"name\": \"MSCI Inc\",\n            \"url\": \"https://msci.com\"\n          },\n          \"slug\": \"msci\",\n          \"directoryUrl\": \"https://claude.ai/directory/2cc10749-99cb-4853-a9d7-b2292ec589fc\",\n          \"worksWith\": [\n            \"claude\",\n            \"claude-api\"\n          ],\n          \"logo\": \"msci\",\n          \"backgroundPattern\": \"Line 1\",\n          \"serverLabel\": \"mcp.msci.com/index/index-mcp/v1.0/mcp\",\n          \"source\": \"manual\",\n          \"visibility\": [\n            \"commercial\"\n          ],\n          \"useCases\": [\n            \"financial-services\"\n          ],\n          \"permissions\": \"Read and write\",\n          \"added_at\": \"2026-02-16\",\n          \"rank\": 113,\n          \"popularityScore\": 12283,\n          \"scoreVersion\": \"v1\",\n          \"trendingScore\": 55122\n        },\n        \"io.modelcontextprotocol.registry/official\": {\n          \"status\": \"active\",\n          \"isLatest\": true\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"server\": {\n        \"name\": \"com.plaid.dashboard.api/plaid-developer-tools\",\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"description\": \"Enables developers to build agents that fetch Plaid Link conversion insights, usage metrics, and Item diagnostics using the Anthropic API.\",\n        \"title\": \"Plaid Developer Tools\",\n        \"remotes\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"sse\",\n            \"url\": \"https://api.dashboard.plaid.com/mcp/sse\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"_meta\": {\n        \"com.anthropic.api/mcp-registry\": {\n          \"uuid\": \"bacac1ad-ccb1-401e-a5d7-915da9742dce\",\n          \"type\": \"remote\",\n          \"toolNames\": [\n            \"plaid_debug_item\",\n            \"plaid_get_link_analytics\",\n            \"plaid_get_usages\",\n            \"plaid_list_teams\"\n          ],\n          \"promptNames\": [],\n          \"isAuthless\": false,\n          \"displayName\": \"Plaid Developer Tools\",\n          \"oneLiner\": \"Monitor, debug, and optimize your Plaid integration\",\n          \"iconUrl\": \"https://api.dashboard.plaid.com/mcp/sse\",\n          \"documentation\": \"https://plaid.com/docs/resources/mcp/\",\n          \"support\": \"https://support-my.plaid.com/hc/\",\n          \"privacyPolicy\": \"https://plaid.com/legal/\",\n          \"url\": \"https://api.dashboard.plaid.com/mcp/sse\",\n          \"author\": {\n            \"name\": \"Plaid\",\n            \"url\": \"https://plaid.com\"\n          },\n          \"slug\": \"plaid\",\n          \"directoryUrl\": \"http://claude.ai/directory/bacac1ad-ccb1-401e-a5d7-915da9742dce\",\n          \"permissions\": \"Read\",\n          \"useCases\": [\n            \"financial-services\"\n          ],\n          \"worksWith\": [\n            \"claude\"\n          ],\n          \"publishedOn\": \"Mon Jan 12 2026 16:21:41 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)\",\n          \"createdOn\": \"Thu Aug 28 2025 14:02:57 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)\",\n          \"updatedOn\": \"Mon Jan 12 2026 16:20:15 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)\",\n          \"logo\": \"plaid\",\n          \"backgroundPattern\": \"Line 1\",\n          \"serverLabel\": \"api.dashboard.plaid.com\",\n          \"itemId\": \"68b06191ac5c2148827a50a9\",\n          \"collectionId\": \"68b05e2de975b4de7dd02d9d\",\n          \"localeId\": \"68a44d4040f98a4adf2207b5\",\n          \"htmlContent\": \"<p id=\\\"\\\">Access bank account data, transaction history, and financial information through Plaid's secure API. Verify account ownership, categorize spending, analyze financial patterns, and enable payment workflows while maintaining bank-level security and compliance for comprehensive financial data integration.<br><br>You can use the Plaid connector to:<br><br>Monitor API usage and consumption:<br>\\\"Get real-time usage metrics across Plaid products and track API request volumes from the past week\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Debug Plaid items:<br>\\\"Diagnose Plaid item {item_id} and retrieve associated metadata to identify connection issues\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Analyze Link conversion metrics:<br>\\\"Retrieve Plaid Link analytics data for the past month and identify areas to optimize conversion and reduce error rates\\\"</p>\",\n          \"source\": \"auto-sync\",\n          \"visibility\": [\n            \"commercial\"\n          ],\n          \"added_at\": \"2025-11-14\",\n          \"rank\": 115,\n          \"popularityScore\": 12167,\n          \"scoreVersion\": \"v1\",\n          \"trendingScore\": 36999,\n          \"sortOrder\": 1\n        },\n        \"io.modelcontextprotocol.registry/official\": {\n          \"status\": \"active\",\n          \"isLatest\": true\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"server\": {\n        \"$schema\": \"https://static.modelcontextprotocol.io/schemas/2025-09-29/server.schema.json\",\n        \"name\": \"io.coupler/remote-mcp-server\",\n        \"description\": \"Analyze multi-channel marketing, financial, sales, e-commerce, and other business data within Claude by connecting to your Coupler.io data flows — query marketing, sales, and finance metrics from hundreds of sources. Fetch and transform raw data from platforms like Google Ads, Facebook, HubSpot, and Salesforce into actionable intelligence for smarter, faster decision-making with accurate, up-to-date business information.\",\n        \"repository\": {},\n        \"version\": \"0.0.1\",\n        \"remotes\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"streamable-http\",\n            \"url\": \"https://mcp.coupler.io/mcp/\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"title\": \"Coupler.io\"\n      },\n      \"_meta\": {\n        \"io.modelcontextprotocol.registry/official\": {\n          \"status\": \"active\",\n          \"publishedAt\": \"2025-09-10T16:12:03.417416Z\",\n          \"updatedAt\": \"2025-09-10T16:12:03.417416Z\",\n          \"isLatest\": true\n        },\n        \"com.anthropic.api/mcp-registry\": {\n          \"uuid\": \"dba65f24-3bd2-4d72-a86c-62b7c5290a5f\",\n          \"type\": \"remote\",\n          \"toolNames\": [\n            \"get-data\",\n            \"get-schema\",\n            \"list-dataflows\",\n            \"get-dataflow\"\n          ],\n          \"promptNames\": [],\n          \"isAuthless\": false,\n          \"displayName\": \"Coupler.io\",\n          \"oneLiner\": \"Access business data from hundreds of sources\",\n          \"iconUrl\": \"https://coupler.io\",\n          \"documentation\": \"https://help.coupler.io/article/592-coupler-local-mcp-server\",\n          \"support\": \"mailto:contact@coupler.io\",\n          \"privacyPolicy\": \"https://www.coupler.io/privacy-policy\",\n          \"url\": \"https://mcp.coupler.io/mcp/\",\n          \"author\": {\n            \"name\": \"Coupler.io\",\n            \"url\": \"https://coupler.io\"\n          },\n          \"slug\": \"coupler-io\",\n          \"directoryUrl\": \"https://claude.ai/directory/dba65f24-3bd2-4d72-a86c-62b7c5290a5f\",\n          \"claudeCodeCopyText\": \"claude mcp add --transport http coupler https://mcp.coupler.io/mcp\",\n          \"permissions\": \"Read\",\n          \"useCases\": [\n            \"sales-and-marketing\"\n          ],\n          \"worksWith\": [\n            \"claude\",\n            \"claude-api\",\n            \"claude-code\"\n          ],\n          \"publishedOn\": \"Mon Jan 12 2026 16:21:41 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)\",\n          \"createdOn\": \"Tue Sep 23 2025 01:14:49 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)\",\n          \"updatedOn\": \"Mon Jan 12 2026 16:20:14 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)\",\n          \"logo\": \"coupler\",\n          \"backgroundPattern\": \"Loop 1\",\n          \"serverLabel\": \"mcp.coupler.io/mcp/\",\n          \"itemId\": \"68d1f489072398bee2c4cebb\",\n          \"collectionId\": \"68b05e2de975b4de7dd02d9d\",\n          \"localeId\": \"68a44d4040f98a4adf2207b5\",\n          \"htmlContent\": \"<p id=\\\"\\\">Analyze multi-channel marketing, financial, sales, e-commerce, and other business data within Claude by connecting to your Coupler.io data flows — query marketing, sales, and finance metrics from hundreds of sources. Fetch and transform raw data from platforms like Google Ads, Facebook, HubSpot, and Salesforce into actionable intelligence for smarter, faster decision-making with accurate, up-to-date business information.</p><p id=\\\"\\\">You can use the Coupler.io connector to:<br><br>Analyze customer acquisition costs:<br>\\\"What's our overall customer acquisition cost across all paid channels this quarter compared to last quarter? I need this for the board meeting\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Review marketing ROI:<br>\\\"Show me the ROI breakdown by marketing channel for the past 6 months. I need to reallocate our annual budget\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Identify high-performing campaigns:<br>\\\"Which campaigns are contributing most to our pipeline revenue? I want to double down on what's working\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Review sales pipeline:<br>\\\"Can you pull the sales pipeline report for this month? I need to see how many deals are in each stage and the total value at each stage\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Analyze conversion rates:<br>\\\"What are our conversion rates from lead to opportunity and from opportunity to closed-won for the last quarter? How do they compare to our targets?\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Forecast revenue:<br>\\\"How many deals are expected to close this month based on their probability scores? What's our forecasted revenue vs our monthly target?\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Compare quarterly profits:<br>\\\"Check the profit for this quarter, compare it to last quarter, and provide a breakdown by department\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Generate cash flow reports:<br>\\\"Could you provide a cash flow report for the last 30 days, including all incoming and outgoing transactions?\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Review accounts receivable:<br>\\\"Share the current accounts receivable status and tell me how many overdue invoices we have and which customers owe the most\\\"</p>\",\n          \"source\": \"auto-sync\",\n          \"visibility\": [\n            \"commercial\"\n          ],\n          \"added_at\": \"2025-11-12\",\n          \"rank\": 116,\n          \"popularityScore\": 12161,\n          \"scoreVersion\": \"v1\",\n          \"trendingScore\": 42132\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"server\": {\n        \"name\": \"io.customer/mcp\",\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"title\": \"Customer.io\",\n        \"description\": \"Let Claude work directly with your Customer.io workspace to create segments, inspect user profiles, search for customers, and access workspace data. Analyze customer attributes, manage audience targeting, and explore your workspace without switching tabs.\",\n        \"remotes\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"streamable-http\",\n            \"url\": \"{url}\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"_meta\": {\n        \"com.anthropic.api/mcp-registry\": {\n          \"uuid\": \"e46d22da-f472-465a-ae46-52f6ac61a97f\",\n          \"type\": \"remote\",\n          \"toolNames\": [\n            \"create\",\n            \"get\",\n            \"list\",\n            \"list_workspaces\",\n            \"sdk_setup\",\n            \"search\"\n          ],\n          \"promptNames\": [],\n          \"urlRegex\": \"\\\\.customer\\\\.io(/|$)\",\n          \"requiredFields\": [\n            {\n              \"field\": \"url\",\n              \"sourceUrl\": \"https://docs.customer.io/ai/mcp-server/\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"isAuthless\": false,\n          \"displayName\": \"Customer.io\",\n          \"oneLiner\": \"Explore customer data and generate insights via Claude\",\n          \"iconUrl\": \"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/onirtmj2/production/e1ead94ff38d1ec15140dc0879661ed1b3bd1857-259x258.svg\",\n          \"documentation\": \"https://docs.customer.io/ai/mcp-server/\",\n          \"support\": \"mailto:win@customer.io\",\n          \"privacyPolicy\": \"https://customer.io/legal/privacy-policy\",\n          \"url\": \"{url}\",\n          \"author\": {\n            \"name\": \"Customer.io\",\n            \"url\": \"https://customer.io/\"\n          },\n          \"slug\": \"customer-io\",\n          \"directoryUrl\": \"https://claude.ai/directory/e46d22da-f472-465a-ae46-52f6ac61a97f\",\n          \"claudeCodeCopyText\": \"claude mcp add --transport http customer-io {url}\\n\",\n          \"worksWith\": [\n            \"claude\",\n            \"claude-api\",\n            \"claude-code\"\n          ],\n          \"logo\": \"customer-io\",\n          \"backgroundPattern\": \"Line 1\",\n          \"source\": \"manual\",\n          \"visibility\": [\n            \"commercial\"\n          ],\n          \"useCases\": [\n            \"sales-and-marketing\"\n          ],\n          \"permissions\": \"Read and write\",\n          \"added_at\": \"2026-02-28\",\n          \"rank\": 117,\n          \"popularityScore\": 12131,\n          \"scoreVersion\": \"v1\",\n          \"trendingScore\": 57236\n        },\n        \"io.modelcontextprotocol.registry/official\": {\n          \"status\": \"active\",\n          \"isLatest\": true\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"server\": {\n        \"name\": \"com.gusto/mcp\",\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"title\": \"Gusto\",\n        \"description\": \"Connect Claude to your Gusto account to query and analyze your payroll and people data. Ask questions in natural language, build custom reports, and create charts to uncover trends and insights—no exports or tool-switching required. Eligible customers can also run payroll in Claude.\",\n        \"remotes\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"streamable-http\",\n            \"url\": \"https://mcp.api.gusto.com/anthropic\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"_meta\": {\n        \"com.anthropic.api/mcp-registry\": {\n          \"uuid\": \"cf2b53a4-45ef-4541-9425-0116d42286ca\",\n          \"type\": \"remote\",\n          \"toolNames\": [\n            \"get_company\",\n            \"get_compensation\",\n            \"get_contractor\",\n            \"get_contractor_payment\",\n            \"get_contractor_payment_group\",\n            \"get_department\",\n            \"get_employee\",\n            \"get_home_address\",\n            \"get_rehire\",\n            \"get_work_address\",\n            \"get_job\",\n            \"get_location\",\n            \"get_pay_schedule\",\n            \"get_payroll\",\n            \"get_time_sheet\",\n            \"get_token_info\",\n            \"list_contractor_payment_groups\",\n            \"list_contractor_payments\",\n            \"list_contractors\",\n            \"list_custom_fields\",\n            \"list_departments\",\n            \"list_earning_types\",\n            \"list_employee_custom_fields\",\n            \"list_employee_employments\",\n            \"list_employee_home_addresses\",\n            \"list_employee_jobs\",\n            \"list_employee_separations\",\n            \"list_employee_work_addresses\",\n            \"list_employees\",\n            \"list_job_compensations\",\n            \"list_locations\",\n            \"list_pay_periods\",\n            \"list_pay_schedule_assignments\",\n            \"list_pay_schedules\",\n            \"list_payroll_blockers\",\n            \"list_payrolls\",\n            \"list_time_sheets\",\n            \"query_faq\",\n            \"calculate_payroll\",\n            \"submit_payroll\",\n            \"run_payroll\"\n          ],\n          \"promptNames\": [],\n          \"isAuthless\": false,\n          \"displayName\": \"Gusto\",\n          \"oneLiner\": \"Query and analyze your Gusto data\",\n          \"iconUrl\": \"https://gusto.com\",\n          \"documentation\": \"https://docs.gusto.com/app-integrations/docs/mcp\",\n          \"support\": \"mailto:mcp@gusto.com\",\n          \"privacyPolicy\": \"https://gusto.com/legal/privacy\",\n          \"url\": \"https://mcp.api.gusto.com/anthropic\",\n          \"author\": {\n            \"name\": \"Gusto\",\n            \"url\": \"https://gusto.com\"\n          },\n          \"slug\": \"gusto\",\n          \"directoryUrl\": \"https://claude.ai/directory/cf2b53a4-45ef-4541-9425-0116d42286ca\",\n          \"worksWith\": [\n            \"claude\",\n            \"claude-api\"\n          ],\n          \"logo\": \"gusto\",\n          \"backgroundPattern\": \"Line 1\",\n          \"serverLabel\": \"mcp.api.gusto.com/anthropic\",\n          \"source\": \"manual\",\n          \"visibility\": [\n            \"commercial\"\n          ],\n          \"useCases\": [\n            \"financial-services\"\n          ],\n          \"permissions\": \"Read and write\",\n          \"hasMcpApp\": true,\n          \"added_at\": \"2026-02-28\",\n          \"rank\": 118,\n          \"popularityScore\": 12117,\n          \"scoreVersion\": \"v1\",\n          \"trendingScore\": 96379,\n          \"sortOrder\": 1\n        },\n        \"io.modelcontextprotocol.registry/official\": {\n          \"status\": \"active\",\n          \"isLatest\": true\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"server\": {\n        \"$schema\": \"https://static.modelcontextprotocol.io/schemas/2025-12-11/server.schema.json\",\n        \"name\": \"io.github.DiceHoldingsInc/dice-mcp\",\n        \"description\": \"Access Dice's database of active tech jobs through conversational AI search. With 30+ years of tech-only specialization, Dice offers unparalleled breadth and depth—covering every tech discipline from AI/ML to cybersecurity, across companies of all sizes. Use natural language to search faster and more easily than ever. Ask for what you want conversationally, refine your criteria through chat, and navigate to real opportunities. Skip the complexity of traditional job board filters and narrow down your job search within Claude.\",\n        \"title\": \"Dice\",\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"remotes\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"streamable-http\",\n            \"url\": \"https://mcp.dice.com/mcp\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"_meta\": {\n        \"io.modelcontextprotocol.registry/official\": {\n          \"status\": \"active\",\n          \"publishedAt\": \"2026-01-05T21:43:49.734328Z\",\n          \"updatedAt\": \"2026-01-05T21:43:49.734328Z\",\n          \"isLatest\": true\n        },\n        \"com.anthropic.api/mcp-registry\": {\n          \"uuid\": \"3035842b-464b-45f0-b8f0-1ddc01fb2eb2\",\n          \"type\": \"remote\",\n          \"toolNames\": [\n            \"search_jobs\"\n          ],\n          \"promptNames\": [],\n          \"isAuthless\": true,\n          \"displayName\": \"Dice\",\n          \"oneLiner\": \"Find active tech jobs on Dice\",\n          \"iconUrl\": \"https://www.dice.com/\",\n          \"documentation\": \"https://www.dice.com/about/mcp\",\n          \"support\": \"https://www.dice.com/about/contact-us\",\n          \"privacyPolicy\": \"https://www.dice.com/about/privacy-policy\",\n          \"url\": \"https://mcp.dice.com/mcp\",\n          \"author\": {\n            \"name\": \"Dice.com\",\n            \"url\": \"https://www.dice.com/\"\n          },\n          \"worksWith\": [\n            \"claude\",\n            \"claude-api\",\n            \"claude-code\"\n          ],\n          \"source\": \"auto-sync\",\n          \"visibility\": [\n            \"commercial\"\n          ],\n          \"added_at\": \"2026-01-12\",\n          \"useCases\": [\n            \"productivity\"\n          ],\n          \"rank\": 119,\n          \"popularityScore\": 12097,\n          \"scoreVersion\": \"v1\",\n          \"trendingScore\": 75704\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"server\": {\n        \"name\": \"org.learningcommons.mcp.kg/learning-commons-knowledge-graph\",\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"description\": \"Align to all 50 states’ academic standards, break them into granular learning components, and trace learning progressions directly from Claude. The Learning Commons Knowledge Graph connects trusted instructional content and learning science into a shared foundation, so Claude can generate more precise, standards-aligned instructional content that supports coherent learning and reflects educational best practices.\",\n        \"title\": \"Learning Commons Knowledge Graph\",\n        \"remotes\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"streamable-http\",\n            \"url\": \"https://kg.mcp.learningcommons.org/mcp\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"_meta\": {\n        \"com.anthropic.api/mcp-registry\": {\n          \"uuid\": \"6e94f5fc-5dc8-4f0a-9fcf-741bcab4e034\",\n          \"type\": \"remote\",\n          \"toolNames\": [\n            \"find_learning_components_from_standard\",\n            \"find_standards_progression_from_standard\",\n            \"find_standard_statement\"\n          ],\n          \"promptNames\": [],\n          \"isAuthless\": true,\n          \"displayName\": \"Learning Commons Knowledge Graph\",\n          \"oneLiner\": \"K-12 standards, skills, and learning progressions\",\n          \"iconUrl\": \"https://learningcommons.org\",\n          \"documentation\": \"https://docs.learningcommons.org/knowledge-graph/integrations/claude\",\n          \"support\": \"mailto:support@learningcommons.org\",\n          \"privacyPolicy\": \"https://learningcommons.org/privacy-policy/\",\n          \"url\": \"https://kg.mcp.learningcommons.org/mcp\",\n          \"author\": {\n            \"name\": \"Learning Commons Knowledge Graph\",\n            \"url\": \"https://learningcommons.org/\"\n          },\n          \"slug\": \"learning-commons-knowledge-graph\",\n          \"directoryUrl\": \"https://claude.ai/directory/6e94f5fc-5dc8-4f0a-9fcf-741bcab4e034\",\n          \"permissions\": \"Read\",\n          \"worksWith\": [\n            \"claude\",\n            \"claude-api\"\n          ],\n          \"publishedOn\": \"Mon Jan 12 2026 16:21:41 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)\",\n          \"createdOn\": \"Tue Sep 23 2025 01:00:52 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)\",\n          \"updatedOn\": \"Mon Jan 12 2026 16:20:17 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)\",\n          \"logo\": \"learning-commons\",\n          \"backgroundPattern\": \"Loop 1\",\n          \"serverLabel\": \"kg.mcp.learningcommons.org/mcp\",\n          \"itemId\": \"68d1f14431c6258a78bdad70\",\n          \"collectionId\": \"68b05e2de975b4de7dd02d9d\",\n          \"localeId\": \"68a44d4040f98a4adf2207b5\",\n          \"htmlContent\": \"<p id=\\\"\\\">Align to all 50 states' academic standards, break them into granular learning components, and trace learning progressions directly from Claude. The Learning Commons Knowledge Graph connects trusted instructional content and learning science into a shared foundation, so Claude can generate more precise, standards-aligned instructional content that supports coherent learning and reflects educational best practices.</p><p id=\\\"\\\">You can use the Learning Commons connector to:<br><br>Generate standards-aligned project ideas:<br>\\\"I'm a teacher in Iowa. Generate three project ideas that address W.3.4\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Create exit tickets for specific standards:<br>\\\"Today in class we will be covering 111.40.c.3.F. Can you please create an exit ticket for my students?\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Generate practice problems for learning components:<br>\\\"I am an 8th grade teacher in Maryland. Please create extra practice problems to address the learning components of 8.F.B.4\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Identify prerequisite skills:<br>\\\"I am a 4th grade teacher in California. A student in my new class is struggling with the concepts related to 4.OA.A.3. Which prerequisites should I focus on with them?\\\"<br><br>This connector is designed for K-12 educators and curriculum developers.</p>\",\n          \"source\": \"auto-sync\",\n          \"visibility\": [\n            \"commercial\"\n          ],\n          \"added_at\": \"2025-11-12\",\n          \"useCases\": [\n            \"productivity\"\n          ],\n          \"rank\": 120,\n          \"popularityScore\": 12044,\n          \"scoreVersion\": \"v1\",\n          \"trendingScore\": 40478\n        },\n        \"io.modelcontextprotocol.registry/official\": {\n          \"status\": \"active\",\n          \"isLatest\": true\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"server\": {\n        \"name\": \"com.cloudinary.mcp.asset-management/cloudinary\",\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"description\": \"The Cloudinary MCP servers enable you to upload, manage, transform, and analyze your media assets.\",\n        \"title\": \"Cloudinary\",\n        \"remotes\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"sse\",\n            \"url\": \"https://asset-management.mcp.cloudinary.com/sse\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"_meta\": {\n        \"com.anthropic.api/mcp-registry\": {\n          \"uuid\": \"c93e842b-830f-4b4a-bbd1-6e3af0199a8f\",\n          \"type\": \"remote\",\n          \"toolNames\": [\n            \"upload-asset\",\n            \"asset-public_id-rename\",\n            \"download-asset\",\n            \"generate-archive\",\n            \"download-asset-backup\",\n            \"delete-asset\",\n            \"list-images\",\n            \"list-videos\",\n            \"list-files\",\n            \"get-asset-details\",\n            \"asset-update\",\n            \"list-tags\",\n            \"delete-derived-assets\",\n            \"get-usage-details\",\n            \"create-asset-relations\",\n            \"delete-asset-relations\",\n            \"move-folder\",\n            \"create-folder\",\n            \"delete-folder\",\n            \"search-folders\",\n            \"search-assets\",\n            \"visual-search-assets\"\n          ],\n          \"promptNames\": [],\n          \"isAuthless\": false,\n          \"displayName\": \"Cloudinary\",\n          \"oneLiner\": \"Manage, transform and deliver your images & videos\",\n          \"iconUrl\": \"https://asset-management.mcp.cloudinary.com/sse\",\n          \"documentation\": \"https://cloudinary.com/documentation/cloudinary_llm_mcp#available_mcp_servers\",\n          \"support\": \"https://support.cloudinary.com/hc/en-us\",\n          \"privacyPolicy\": \"https://cloudinary.com/privacy\",\n          \"url\": \"https://asset-management.mcp.cloudinary.com/sse\",\n          \"author\": {\n            \"name\": \"Cloudinary\",\n            \"url\": \"https://cloudinary.com/\"\n          },\n          \"slug\": \"cloudinary\",\n          \"directoryUrl\": \"https://claude.ai/directory/c93e842b-830f-4b4a-bbd1-6e3af0199a8f\",\n          \"claudeCodeCopyText\": \"claude mcp add --transport http cloudinary https://asset-management.mcp.cloudinary.com/sse\",\n          \"permissions\": \"Read and write\",\n          \"useCases\": [\n            \"data\",\n            \"code\"\n          ],\n          \"worksWith\": [\n            \"claude\",\n            \"claude-api\",\n            \"claude-code\"\n          ],\n          \"publishedOn\": \"Mon Jan 12 2026 16:21:41 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)\",\n          \"createdOn\": \"Thu Aug 28 2025 14:02:55 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)\",\n          \"updatedOn\": \"Mon Jan 12 2026 16:20:14 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)\",\n          \"logo\": \"cloudinary\",\n          \"backgroundPattern\": \"Line 1\",\n          \"serverLabel\": \"asset-management.mcp.cloudinary.com/sse\",\n          \"itemId\": \"68b0618f2f29acedd03dabad\",\n          \"collectionId\": \"68b05e2de975b4de7dd02d9d\",\n          \"localeId\": \"68a44d4040f98a4adf2207b5\",\n          \"htmlContent\": \"<p id=\\\"\\\">The Cloudinary connector enables you to upload, manage, transform, and analyze your media assets.</p><p id=\\\"\\\">You can use the Cloudinary connector to:<br><br>Upload media:<br>\\\"Upload an image/video from &lt;URL/local file&gt; to my Cloudinary account\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Organize assets:<br>\\\"Find all assets with tag=cat and move them to the folder named 'cats'\\\"</p><p id=\\\"\\\">Create platform-specific variations:<br>\\\"Create 3 variations of this image so it would fit Instagram story, Instagram post and Twitter, add my company logo as a watermark to those images\\\"</p>\",\n          \"source\": \"auto-sync\",\n          \"visibility\": [\n            \"commercial\"\n          ],\n          \"added_at\": \"2025-11-12\",\n          \"rank\": 121,\n 