ss Sprouts.ai's B2B prospect database through natural language queries. Search for contacts and companies by job title, industry, location, company size, and more\",\n        \"title\": \"Sprouts Data Intelligence\",\n        \"remotes\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"streamable-http\",\n            \"url\": \"https://sprouts-mcp-server.kartikay-dhar.workers.dev\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"_meta\": {\n        \"com.anthropic.api/mcp-registry\": {\n          \"uuid\": \"fadebf8c-fa8d-42f0-b754-4635bd480ab0\",\n          \"type\": \"remote\",\n          \"toolNames\": [\n            \"sprouts_data_intelligence\",\n            \"move_to_sprouts\",\n            \"query_templates\",\n            \"query_refinement\",\n            \"search_history\",\n            \"icp_analysis\",\n            \"sprouts_user_preferences\"\n          ],\n          \"promptNames\": [],\n          \"isAuthless\": false,\n          \"displayName\": \"Sprouts Data Intelligence\",\n          \"oneLiner\": \"From query to qualified lead in seconds.\",\n          \"iconUrl\": \"https://sprouts.ai\",\n          \"documentation\": \"https://support.sprouts.ai/en/articles/13384582-sprouts-mcp-server-documentation#h_541c149a52\",\n          \"support\": \"https://sprouts.ai/contact\",\n          \"privacyPolicy\": \"https://sprouts.ai/privacy-policy\",\n          \"url\": \"https://sprouts-mcp-server.kartikay-dhar.workers.dev\",\n          \"author\": {\n            \"name\": \"Sprouts.ai\",\n            \"url\": \"https://sprouts.ai\"\n          },\n          \"slug\": \"sprouts\",\n          \"directoryUrl\": \"https://claude.ai/directory/fadebf8c-fa8d-42f0-b754-4635bd480ab0\",\n          \"claudeCodeCopyText\": \"claude mcp add --transport http sprouts https://sprouts-mcp-server.kartikay-dhar.workers.dev\\n\",\n          \"worksWith\": [\n            \"claude\",\n            \"claude-api\",\n            \"claude-code\"\n          ],\n          \"logo\": \"sprouts\",\n          \"backgroundPattern\": \"Line 1\",\n          \"serverLabel\": \"sprouts-mcp-server.kartikay-dhar.workers.dev\",\n          \"source\": \"manual\",\n          \"visibility\": [\n            \"commercial\"\n          ],\n          \"useCases\": [\n            \"sales-and-marketing\"\n          ],\n          \"permissions\": \"Read and write\",\n          \"added_at\": \"2026-02-18\",\n          \"rank\": 174,\n          \"popularityScore\": 9718,\n          \"scoreVersion\": \"v1\",\n          \"trendingScore\": 69502\n        },\n        \"io.modelcontextprotocol.registry/official\": {\n          \"status\": \"active\",\n          \"isLatest\": true\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"server\": {\n        \"name\": \"io.apollographql.mcp/graphos-tools\",\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"description\": \"Apollo GraphOS Tools is a hosted MCP server that gives AI coding agents direct access to Apollo's official documentation and the Apollo Connectors specification. It provides three tools: Docs Search lets agents query across Apollo's documentation to find relevant guides, examples, and best practices for GraphQL, GraphOS, schema design, and deployment. Docs Read retrieves the full Markdown content of any documentation page so agents can provide complete, detailed guidance. Connectors Spec gives agents access to the official Apollo Connectors specification for creating and modifying REST-to-GraphQL integrations. No authentication or setup is required — just point any MCP-compatible client at the endpoint and start building.\",\n        \"title\": \"GraphOS MCP Tools\",\n        \"remotes\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"streamable-http\",\n            \"url\": \"https://mcp.apollographql.com\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"_meta\": {\n        \"com.anthropic.api/mcp-registry\": {\n          \"uuid\": \"b97d991c-e50a-4345-8aa8-8e42ec8e99bc\",\n          \"type\": \"remote\",\n          \"toolNames\": [\n            \"ApolloDocsSearch\",\n            \"ApolloDocsRead\",\n            \"ApolloConnectorsSpec\"\n          ],\n          \"promptNames\": [],\n          \"isAuthless\": true,\n          \"displayName\": \"GraphOS MCP Tools\",\n          \"oneLiner\": \"Search Apollo docs, specs, and best practices\",\n          \"iconUrl\": \"https://www.datocms-assets.com/102461/1728074900-symbol.png\",\n          \"documentation\": \"https://www.apollographql.com/docs/graphos/platform/graphos-mcp-tools\",\n          \"support\": \"https://community.apollographql.com/c/mcp-server/41\",\n          \"privacyPolicy\": \"https://www.apollographql.com/privacy-policy\",\n          \"url\": \"https://mcp.apollographql.com\",\n          \"author\": {\n            \"name\": \"Apollo GraphQL\",\n            \"url\": \"https://www.apollographql.com\"\n          },\n          \"slug\": \"graphos-tools\",\n          \"directoryUrl\": \"https://claude.ai/directory/b97d991c-e50a-4345-8aa8-8e42ec8e99bc\",\n          \"claudeCodeCopyText\": \"claude mcp add --transport http graphos-tools https://mcp.apollographql.com\\n\",\n          \"worksWith\": [\n            \"claude\",\n            \"claude-code\"\n          ],\n          \"logo\": \"graphos-tools\",\n          \"backgroundPattern\": \"Line 1\",\n          \"serverLabel\": \"mcp.apollographql.com\",\n          \"source\": \"manual\",\n          \"visibility\": [\n            \"commercial\"\n          ],\n          \"added_at\": \"2026-02-23\",\n          \"useCases\": [\n            \"code\"\n          ],\n          \"permissions\": \"Read\",\n          \"rank\": 175,\n          \"popularityScore\": 9449,\n          \"scoreVersion\": \"v1\",\n          \"trendingScore\": 61734\n        },\n        \"io.modelcontextprotocol.registry/official\": {\n          \"status\": \"active\",\n          \"isLatest\": true\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"server\": {\n        \"name\": \"com.signnow/mcp\",\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"description\": \"Get documents signed faster without switching between tools. The SignNow MCP server connects Claude directly to your SignNow account, letting you manage the entire eSignature workflow through conversation. Send signature requests, create documents from templates and pre-fill them, track invite statuses, and retrieve signed files — all by describing what you need in plain language. Whether you're handling contracts, agreements, or approvals, Claude handles the SignNow actions so you can focus on your work instead of chasing signatures.\",\n        \"title\": \"SignNow\",\n        \"remotes\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"streamable-http\",\n            \"url\": \"https://mcp-server.signnow.com/mcp\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"_meta\": {\n        \"com.anthropic.api/mcp-registry\": {\n          \"uuid\": \"4bf06559-36bf-4aab-b7f7-360af4e2db86\",\n          \"type\": \"remote\",\n          \"toolNames\": [\n            \"list_all_templates\",\n            \"list_documents\",\n            \"send_invite\",\n            \"create_embedded_invite\",\n            \"create_embedded_sending\",\n            \"create_embedded_editor\",\n            \"create_from_template\",\n            \"send_invite_from_template\",\n            \"create_embedded_sending_from_template\",\n            \"create_embedded_editor_from_template\",\n            \"create_embedded_invite_from_template\",\n            \"get_invite_status\",\n            \"get_document_download_link\",\n            \"get_signing_link\",\n            \"get_document\",\n            \"update_document_fields\"\n          ],\n          \"promptNames\": [],\n          \"isAuthless\": false,\n          \"displayName\": \"SignNow\",\n          \"oneLiner\": \"Automate eSignature workflows directly from Claude\",\n          \"iconUrl\": \"https://www.signnow.com\",\n          \"documentation\": \"https://docs.signnow.com/docs/signnow/mcp-server\",\n          \"support\": \"mailto:api@signnow.com\",\n          \"privacyPolicy\": \"https://legal.signnow.com/privacy-notice\",\n          \"url\": \"https://mcp-server.signnow.com/mcp\",\n          \"author\": {\n            \"name\": \"airSlate Inc\",\n            \"url\": \"https://www.airslate.com/\"\n          },\n          \"slug\": \"signnow\",\n          \"directoryUrl\": \"https://claude.ai/directory/4bf06559-36bf-4aab-b7f7-360af4e2db86\",\n          \"worksWith\": [\n            \"claude\",\n            \"claude-api\"\n          ],\n          \"logo\": \"signnow\",\n          \"backgroundPattern\": \"Line 1\",\n          \"serverLabel\": \"mcp-server.signnow.com/mcp\",\n          \"source\": \"manual\",\n          \"visibility\": [\n            \"commercial\"\n          ],\n          \"useCases\": [\n            \"productivity\"\n          ],\n          \"permissions\": \"Read and write\",\n          \"added_at\": \"2026-03-07\",\n          \"rank\": 176,\n          \"popularityScore\": 9447,\n          \"scoreVersion\": \"v1\",\n          \"trendingScore\": 148581\n        },\n        \"io.modelcontextprotocol.registry/official\": {\n          \"status\": \"active\",\n          \"isLatest\": true\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"server\": {\n        \"name\": \"com.lilt/mcp\",\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"description\": \"Seamlessly integrate high-quality, guaranteed translation capabilities directly into your Claude instance, bringing your brand's unique context where you already work. Submit content for brand-aligned translation via customized AI or human-verified translation with a simple prompt, ensuring the highest quality while you maintain full control.\",\n        \"title\": \"LILT\",\n        \"remotes\": [\n          {\n            \"type\": \"streamable-http\",\n            \"url\": \"https://mcp.lilt.com/mcp\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"_meta\": {\n        \"com.anthropic.api/mcp-registry\": {\n          \"uuid\": \"88245f33-e3a7-468f-ae27-3f118